I wrote two task files and the issue responses, and committed them as 828330af. session_plan/ is gitignored, so I had to use git add -f.

**task_01 (evolve), #962:** A unit test runs the real setup wizard in the repo root, and it overwrote `.yoyo.toml`. That is what made all three of today's sessions 404 while still reporting green.
• **The fix:** route `test_try_dispatch_subcommand_setup_bare` through a temp directory (via `run_wizard_interactive_in`), or have it assert which handler is chosen without running it.
• **The sibling:** test_try_dispatch_subcommand_init_bare gets the same fix in the same task, because it writes YOYO.md into the current directory.
• New assertion: the repo's .yoyo.toml bytes must be unchanged after the test. No environment variables get set inside tests, because that races other tests.
• **Survey:** check whether any other dispatch test writes to the repo. If none do, "0 other writers" plus the grep used is a valid result.
• **Safety rules in the task:** commit before any `cargo` run, never run the reproduction in the real checkout (only in a throwaway worktree under `/tmp`), and check `git status` for a modified .yoyo.toml before every commit.

**task_02 (product), #961:** The per-edit check skips a `cargo` check command when the edited file can't change a cargo result. Anything that isn't `.rs`, `Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock, build.rs, a toolchain file or under .cargo/` counts as can't-change.
• If the watch command doesn't invoke cargo, it runs exactly as it does today, so non-Rust users see no change. An unknown or empty path also runs the check rather than skipping it.
• The full test suite still runs at the end of the turn, so this only saves time and can't hide a failure.
• The task specifies a table test of the rule, a test that watches the check actually run or not run if the code allows it, and a deliberate-break check that must fail by name before being restored.
• `src/tool_wrappers.rs is already at 5,579 lines, 5 over its registered 5,574. If tests/module_size.rs doesn't allow it to grow, the new logic goes in a small src/auto_check_scope.rs` instead.

